      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然就说『希望能教教我』，\n果然还是太失礼了吧……。\n正当我反省着下次要向她道歉时，几天后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "67624af61db72fd62f2c5feecba7b2cca28c2cdb43805cee0e0b9965e0000a85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
